+	/*
+	 * Let lease devices send drm_fd/connector/done, then skip the ones that
+	 * did not: mutter keeps a wp_drm_lease_device_v1 global for every removed
+	 * secondary GPU (evdi, GNOME mutter #710) and those stale globals never
